module-ssh 0.1

- server-side SSH and SFTP foundations based on libssh
- typed `Qore::Ssh` server, session, command, and SFTP contracts
- live SFTP backend dispatch with typed helper and backend request/result hashes
- generic `SshServerConnections` `ConnectionProvider` module for local SSH/SFTP server instances
- generic `SftpServerDataProvider` `DataProvider` module for virtual SFTP exchange workflows
- config-driven inbound SFTP submission events through `inbound-file-accepted`
- typed inbound SFTP acceptance policies with filename glob/regex and size controls
- generic `VirtualSshCommandService` for SSH command virtualization without a command-side `DataProvider`
- runnable SSH command and SFTP policy/event examples
- directory-module layout for all qlib user modules with split internal `.qc` implementation files
